<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Beteiligungs prices rights issue.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Beteiligungs prices rights issue.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, April 10, Reuter -</p>
<p>Ordinary shares</p>
<p>Nominal share value 50 marks unless otherwise stated</p>
<p>Terms : One new share for three already held.</p>
<p>Subscription period : April 18 to May 2</p>
<p>Number of new shares : 3.0 million</p>
<p>Price of new shares : 17.50 marks</p>
<p>New shares entitled to dividend for the full year 1996/97, running to October 31, 1997.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name of the German industrial holdings group is Deutsche Beteiligungs AG. The issue plans to raise capital by a nominal 15 million marks to 60 million marks.</p>
</text>
